OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny isolated mist and fog soon
OL,6,Fclearing to a dry day with long sunny
OL,7,Fspells before clouding over towards
OL,8,Fthe evening. Light winds but feeling
OL,9,Fchilly even with Autumn sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,12,Fbut rain spreading north accompanied
OL,13,Fby freshening winds, rain heavy in the
OL,14,Feast for a time.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FRain clearing from the west
OL,17,Fduring the morning with some bright or
OL,18,Fsunny spells for the afternoon, still
OL,19,Fquite breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
