OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend, rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds spread east on Saturday.
OL,8,FGales Saturday night and further
OL,9,Fbluster showers on Sunday. Likely
OL,10,Ffurther outbreaks of rain on Monday.
